// # Retirement Execution Plan — Absorbed Standalone Repos (DRAFT, read-only)
//
// Logline: Exact archive/redirect steps for every standalone repo whose
//          persona-ownership.oot token is absorbed into a live canonical
//          host, grouped by org, with pre-archive gates and rollback notes.
//
// Setup:   Draft for manager approval — zero moves executed. Inventory =
//          persona-ownership.oot §2 absorbed tokens intersected with live
//          github repos per org (gh repo list, 2026-11-06). Tokens with no
//          repo (pure persona names) need no action. Mode column: A =
//          archive-only, T = tombstone-commit then archive.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Inventory totals + the bb precedent.
//   2. Per-org retirement tables (154 ready).
//   3. Blocked set (12) — canonical missing, absorb target does not exist.
//   4. Standard gates G1–G6 per wave.
//   5. Wave order + rollback.

== 1. Inventory + precedent ==

154 repos ready (canonical live), 12 blocked (canonical missing).
Precedent: openOODA/bb is archived already — description intact, default
branch master, plain archive with no tombstone. Two modes: A archive-only
(history self-documents), T tombstone README commit + push + archive
(explicit pointer for renamed/absorbed sources users may have bookmarked).

